  "description": "BigTreeTech's SilentStepStick-compatible TMC2240 driver module. The TMC2240 is a smart high-performance stepper motor driver IC with SPI and Single Wire UART serial communication interfaces and extensive diagnosis capabilities, operating from 4.5–36V DC and delivering IRMS = 2.1 A RMS (3 A sine-wave peak) with IMAX = 5.0 A bridge peak current and up to 256 microsteps per full step.",
